  |<back:#EBF5FB>  </back>| application.service «Use Cases»         |
  |<back:#EAF0FB>  </back>| domain.model  Entidades / Strategies     |
  |<back:#EAFAF1>  </back>| domain.port   Puertos / Interfaces       |
  |<back:#E8F8F5>  </back>| infrastructure.persistence JPA Adapters |
  |<back:#FFF8E1>  </back>| infrastructure.sender WireMock SMTP      |
  ----
  <b>ADRs aplicables:</b>
